 ## Background
-DreamFusion was introduced in September 2022 [S1, S5]. It was proposed as a text-to-3D diffusion NeRF model that uses images from 2D diffusion models (specifically Imagen) to train a NeRF from scratch [S1]. The method addresses the lack of large-scale 3D training datasets by sidestepping explicit 3D supervision altogether [S2]. It builds on [Diffusion-guided Optimization](13230-diffusion-guided-optimization.md) by introducing Score Distillation Sampling (SDS) as the specific gradient computation method [S2, S4]. Subsequent works like Latent-NeRF and Magic3D built upon DreamFusion to address its limitations regarding resolution and detail [S1].
+DreamFusion was introduced in September 2022 [S1][S5, unofficial]. It was proposed as a text-to-3D diffusion NeRF model that uses images from 2D diffusion models (specifically Imagen) to train a NeRF from scratch [S1]. The method addresses the lack of large-scale 3D training datasets by sidestepping explicit 3D supervision altogether [S2]. It builds on [Diffusion-guided Optimization](13230-diffusion-guided-optimization.md) by introducing Score Distillation Sampling (SDS) as the specific gradient computation method [S2, S4]. Subsequent works like Latent-NeRF and Magic3D built upon DreamFusion to address its limitations regarding resolution and detail [S1].
 
